Usage: aether node managed <--control <CONTROL>> <--control-certificate <CONTROL_CERTIFICATE>> <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  events
  members
  redeem
  sync
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
      --control <CONTROL>
      --control-certificate <CONTROL_CERTIFICATE>
  -h, --help                              Print help
